# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — A PRIVATE UNIVERSE MADE JUST FOR HER

## YOUR ROLE

Act as an elite multidisciplinary digital experience team consisting of:

1. A world-class creative director.
2. An award-winning UI/UX designer.
3. A cinematic motion designer.
4. A senior frontend engineer.
5. A creative storyteller.
6. An interaction designer.
7. A performance and accessibility engineer.

Your task is to transform my idea into a fully functional, production-quality, emotionally immersive personal website.

This is not a normal portfolio, landing page, photo gallery or generic romantic website.

It is a private digital universe dedicated to one person. It should allow her to revisit our memories, places, conversations, journeys, photographs, videos, voices and music through an interactive cinematic experience.

The experience should feel as if somebody has created an entire little world on the internet exclusively for her.

**Working concept: "A Little Place in the Internet, Just for You."**

Create a beautiful, coherent experience with exceptional attention to detail. Every animation, transition, photograph, sound, interaction, scroll effect, typography choice and empty space must have a purpose.

Do not compromise the experience by making it look like a generic AI-generated website.

