A hidden URL alone does not count as security.

## 26. Performance requirements

The website must run smoothly on ordinary devices.

Important:
- Optimize images using modern formats such as WebP or AVIF.
- Use responsive image sizes.
- Compress videos.
- Lazy-load offscreen videos and images.
- Use poster images for videos.
- Avoid excessive DOM elements.
- Avoid unnecessary animation libraries.
- Avoid expensive real-time 3D rendering unless justified.
- Use GPU-friendly transform and opacity animations.
- Provide a reduced-motion experience.
- Prevent layout shifts.
- Do not load all media simultaneously.

The site should remain usable even with a slow internet connection.

